{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","x":0,"y":-300,"width":1500,"height":130,"text":"# check_stack.py — утренний обход стека\nУрок: [05 · Python и check_stack.py](../theory/05_python_check_stack.md) · [smoke-тест](../../../glossary/smoke-test.md) · [переменные окружения](../../../glossary/environment-variable.md) · [исключения](../../../glossary/exception.md) · [код выхода](../../../glossary/exit-code.md)","color":"6"},
		{"id":"env","type":"text","x":0,"y":-120,"width":420,"height":200,"text":"**Окружение workspace** (`os.environ`)\n`POSTGRES_HOST=postgres`\n`S3_ENDPOINT=http://silo:9000` + `AWS_*`\n`ICEBERG_CATALOG_URI=…/catalog`\n`ICEBERG_WAREHOUSE=lakehouse`\n\nподмена: `ИМЯ=… cmd` · `env -u ИМЯ cmd`"},
		{"id":"g_main","type":"group","x":500,"y":-120,"width":560,"height":620,"label":"main(): цикл по CHECKS, у каждой проверки свой try/except"},
		{"id":"p","type":"text","x":520,"y":-80,"width":520,"height":120,"text":"**check_postgres**\n`psycopg.connect` → `pg_database`\n{lakekeeper, retail_oltp} − dbs → assert"},
		{"id":"s","type":"text","x":520,"y":60,"width":520,"height":120,"text":"**check_s3** (путь ①)\n`s3fs.S3FileSystem(endpoint_url=S3_ENDPOINT)` · ключи из `AWS_*` сами\n{landing, warehouse} − buckets → assert","color":"2"},
		{"id":"i","type":"text","x":520,"y":200,"width":520,"height":160,"text":"**check_iceberg_and_duckdb** (путь ②)\n`load_catalog(uri, warehouse)` — об S3 ни слова\ncreate_table → append → scan (3 строки) → DuckDB ATTACH → count(*)\n`finally`: purge_table, drop_namespace — без `except`!","color":"5"},
		{"id":"res","type":"text","x":520,"y":390,"width":520,"height":90,"text":"нет исключения → `OK` · исключение → `FAIL <класс>: <текст>`, failed += 1\nитог: `sys.exit(1 if failed else 0)`"},
		{"id":"g_err","type":"group","x":1120,"y":-120,"width":380,"height":620,"label":"🔎 Класс ошибки → этап","color":"1"},
		{"id":"k","type":"text","x":1140,"y":-80,"width":340,"height":80,"text":"`KeyError` — переменной нет (запуск вне workspace)"},
		{"id":"ec","type":"text","x":1140,"y":20,"width":340,"height":90,"text":"`EndpointConnectionError` — S3 не отвечает по адресу"},
		{"id":"nc","type":"text","x":1140,"y":130,"width":340,"height":90,"text":"`NoCredentialsError` — нечем подписать запрос"},
		{"id":"pe","type":"text","x":1140,"y":240,"width":340,"height":90,"text":"`PermissionError … signature` — ключи неверные"},
		{"id":"oe","type":"text","x":1140,"y":350,"width":340,"height":110,"text":"`OperationalError` — Postgres: недоступен или неверный пароль\n`AssertionError` — сервис жив, объектов нет"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1","fromNode":"env","fromSide":"right","toNode":"g_main","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"читает"},
